    "description": "<p>You force the air to explode in a massive conflagration.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces.</strong> Until the beginning of your next turn, all spaces within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point gain the <strong>Hazard (3)</strong> trait.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 round</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can choose to target another point per 2 extra successes. Each affected space must be adjacent to another affected space.</p>",
